  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive ({他動詞|たどうし})\n\nCOMPOUND VERB:\n{言|い}う (to say) + {直|なお}す (to redo/fix)\nThe {直|なお}す adds the meaning of doing again or correcting.\n\nUSAGE:\n- {言|い}い{直|なお}してください (please say it again/rephrase it)\n- {言|い}い{直|なお}すと (to put it differently)\n- {言|い}い{間違|まちが}えを{言|い}い{直|なお}す (to correct a slip of the tongue)\n\nSIMILAR COMPOUND VERBS:\n- {書|か}き{直|なお}す (to rewrite)\n- やり{直|なお}す (to redo)\n- {作|つく}り{直|なお}す (to remake)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {言|い}い{換|か}える (to rephrase, paraphrase)\n- {訂正|ていせい}する (to correct)\n- {修正|しゅうせい}する (to revise)",
